      "source": "A single keyspace XML Element can result in multiple actions. Example: CREATE_DROP. This FactoryBean\ninspects the action required to satisfy the keyspace element, and then returns a Set of atomic\n<a href=\"../core/cql/keyspace/KeyspaceActionSpecification.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.keyspace\"><code>KeyspaceActionSpecification</code></a> required to satisfy the configuration action.",
      "translation": "单个键空间 XML 元素可能导致多个操作。例如：CREATE_DROP。此 FactoryBean 会检查满足键空间元素所需的操作，然后返回一组原子性的<a href=\"../core/cql/keyspace/KeyspaceActionSpecification.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.keyspace\"><code>KeyspaceActionSpecification</code></a>以满足配置操作。",
      "count": 1
    },
